e most popular times, but still...this place can really get packed. You walk in and they give you a little buzzer thing. It all depends on which day you go, sometimes you get the buzzer and sometimes you can go right to a seat. It's not too bad while you wait because there's a lot of shops and bars all down Magazine. So I usually go across the street to Balcony Bar while I wait. It's a win win situation. Now for the food. It's delicious lol . They have some really good flavors and different combinations of tacos th..."},{"business_id":"WXgV2lOUgas7DzTLeDau-w","review_id":"36CPv80GrsKvawPPIr0PSQ","date":"2010-01-08T03:03:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9445651173591614,"text_excerpt":"Raspberry Mojito was strong and good. Calypso beef tacos were excellent. The location is great. I wouldn't come here for the ambiance or to find anything super original, but from what I could tell, everyone at my table enjoyed their food, and the tortilla chips were fresh and delicious. I would recommend it for a quick snack and a drink before heading out for the night."},{"business_id":"WXgV2lOUgas7DzTLeDau-w","review_id":"bxaY8PjpfdxNm4Yj1diykA","date":"2012-02-22T20:21:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9442863464355469,"text_excerpt":"This a great place for a variety of tacos. I had the calypso beef and was really good. They made extra in error of the mussels and the bartender asked if we wanted them. Of course, I said yes! Those were terrific! The broth was yummy enough to drink! The staff is friendly and easy going. There was a bit of a wait, but the wait time provided by the staff was accurate. The drinks are delicious. We had the sangria, which was tasty but would have been better if it had fruit in it and if it was colder. We also had the Jamaican Me Crazy, which was super delicious and strong. You hardly noticed how strong it was, but I could see myself having a few of those and wishing I lived within walking dis..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WXgV2lOUgas7DzTLeDau-w","photo_id":"kqbFBTA9ldQb6K67XGA_2g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kqbFBTA9ldQb6K67XGA_2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8718799948692322},{"business_id":"WXgV2lOUgas7DzTLeDau-w","photo_id":"GfysZlqoZc7hTwaTxhUJZg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GfysZlqoZc7hTwaTxhUJZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8461238145828247},{"business_id":"WXgV2lOUgas7DzTLeDau-w","photo_id":"IWYdjLVpmcUKtwAVV3uibw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IWYdjLVpmcUKtwAVV3uibw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8362962007522583},{"business_id":"WXgV2lOUgas7DzTLeDau-w","photo_id":"oOvVZrwKNh3slGUIck51Qw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/oOvVZrwKNh3slGUIck51Qw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8208680152893066},{"business_id":"WXgV2lOUgas7DzTLeDau-w","photo_id":"qzC-H5TwTeR1-TObNbf7ag","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/qzC-H5TwTeR1-TObNbf7ag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7899903655052185}]},"notebook_case":null}
